\label{lemma-flat-under-gorenstein}
Let $A \to B$ be a flat local homomorphism of Noetherian local rings.
The following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $B$ is Gorenstein, and
\item $A$ and $B/\mathfrak m_A B$ are Gorenstein.
\end{enumerate}

